# ResQIntel Frontend Configuration

# TomTom Maps & Location APIs (https://developer.tomtom.com/)
# Enabled products: Map Display API, Places Search API, Geocoding API, Reverse Geocoding API
# Daily evaluation limit: 2,500 free transactions/day, 5 QPS rate limit
# NOTE: Set your actual API key in frontend/.env.local (which is git-ignored)
VITE_TOMTOM_API_KEY=your_tomtom_api_key_here

# Backend API URL (default: http://127.0.0.1:8000/api)
VITE_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000/api
